      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Osiris e Isis se casaron. Eran hermanos y se querían desde antes de nacer.",
          "en": "Osiris and Isis married. They were brother and sister and had loved each other since before birth."
        },
        {
          "es": "Set se casó con su hermana Neftis.",
          "en": "Set married his sister Nephthys."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mientras tanto, Geb, el dios de la tierra y padre de los cinco, se había vuelto viejo y cansado.",
          "en": "Meanwhile, Geb, the earth god and father of the five, had grown old and tired."
        },
        {
          "es": "Antes que él habían gobernado Ra y luego Shu. Ahora Geb debía elegir al próximo rey.",
          "en": "Ra, then Shu, had ruled before him. Now Geb had to choose the next king."
        },
        {
          "es": "Geb miró a sus hijos y dio la corona a Osiris, el mayor.",
          "en": "Geb looked at his children and gave the crown to Osiris, the eldest."
        }
      ],
